title: Hana
---
<<declare $arcade_girl_interaction_times = 0>>

<<if $arcade_girl_interaction_times == 0>>
  Hana: Hi hi hi! Can you help me?
  -> Sure!
    Hana: Yay! Thank you so much!
    Hana: I really want to get the pink bunny in the machine for my daddy. He's outside waiting for me. He has been really sad today.
    Hana: But the claw keeps dropping it, and I only have two tokens left. Can you please try? Here!
    You gained two tokens.
    <<set $arcade_girl_interaction_times += 1>>
  -> Oh, I don't know...
    Hana: Pleaseeeee?
    Hana: I really want to get the pink bunny in the machine for my daddy. He's outside waiting for me. He has been really sad today.
    Hana: But the claw keeps dropping it, and I only have two tokens left. Can you please try? Here!
    <<PlaySound InteractionManager "Pickup">>
    You gained two tokens.
    <<set $arcade_girl_interaction_times += 1>>
<<elseif $arcade_girl_interaction_times == 1>>
  Hana: Did you get the bunny yet?
  <<if $has_bunny>>
    You: I got the bunny!
    Hana: Thank you thank you thank you! I hope my daddy stops being sad.
    Hana: I'm going to find him now! Bye bye! See you later!
    <<set $arcade_girl_interaction_times = 2>>
  <<else>>
    You: Not quite yet...
    Hana: Aww, that's okay! My daddy always says you can try again!
  <<endif>>
<<else>>
  Hana: Thanks for helping me out!
<<endif>>
===
